Z||000005||sqoach||10-30-2001||03:00 PM||||Pat's new tail lights for the notchback are completely different from any other custom notchback lights I've seen. And it looks like he has taken a lot of time, and put in a lot of thought to these. I think they will use the vette lenses, but I'm not sure. And I think they will be a bit more expensive than the euro's for the fastback. I think he will post pictures on the forum after a while. They look really good so far.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">              <BR>^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><LI>86 SC 2.5L 5spd</FONT>||||reg||10
